TORYBOOK_URL` 환경 변수로 재정의할 수 있습니다. 공개 배포의 기본 URL은 JLCA Storybook입니다. 공식 문서는 JLCA Docs 프로젝트 Pages에 정적 export로 배포합니다."},"368":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"page","content":"재검증 체크리스트","breadcrumbs":["JLCA 디자인 시스템","개발"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation"},"369":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-0","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation","content":"Core package, 공식 문서와 clean deployment build를 독립적으로 확인합니다."},"370":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-1","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#0-환경","content":"0\\. 환경"},"371":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-2","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#1-package와-public-entry","content":"1\\. Package와 public entry"},"372":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-3","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#2-token-결정성과-platform-neutrality","content":"2\\. Token 결정성과 platform neutrality"},"373":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-4","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"3\\. Architecture mutation contract"},"374":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-5","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#4-실제-lint와-dependency-방향","content":"4\\. 실제 lint와 dependency 방향"},"375":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-6","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#5-storybook-purity와-production-build","content":"5\\. Storybook purity와 production build"},"376":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-7","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#6-full-test와-package-artifact","content":"6\\. Full test와 package artifact"},"377":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-8","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#7-package-purity-direct-scan","content":"7\\. Package purity direct scan"},"378":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-9","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#8-공식-문서와-credential-audit","content":"8\\. 공식 문서와 credential audit"},"379":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-10","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#9-clean-app-root-docs-build","content":"9\\. Clean app-root docs build"},"380":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-11","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#10-최종-integrity","content":"10\\. 최종 integrity"},"381":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-12","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development/revalidation#실패-귀속","content":"실패 귀속"},"382":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-13","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation","content":"이 절차는 현재 독립 저장소의 public package, architecture, Storybook과 공식 문서를 재검증한다. 각 command, exit code, test/violation count와 warning/error 귀속을 기록한다. 실패를 발견하면 diff와 merge base에서 재현 여부를 먼저 판정한다."},"383":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-14","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#0-환경","content":"기대값은 Node `24.x`, pnpm `9.12.1`, frozen install 성공이다. 시작 status가 clean이 아니면 기존 변경을 보존하고 검증으로 생긴 delta와 구분한다."},"384":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-15","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#1-package와-public-entry","content":"각각 `packages/tokens`, `packages/foundation`, `packages/primitives`, `packages/compositions`를 가리켜야 한다. manifest `exports`는 Tokens runtime와 `web.css`, Foundation `styles.css`, Primitives/Compositions root runtime와 type을 dist artifact로 공개해야 한다."},"385":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-16","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#1-package와-public-entry","content":"packed artifact contract는 실제 tarball을 설치해 root runtime/type/CSS export와 downstream compile을 확인한다. source deep import가 pack 결과에 새어 나오면 실패해야 한다."},"386":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-17","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#2-token-결정성과-platform-neutrality","content":"`tokens:check`는 generator를 실행한 뒤 generated CSS drift와 contrast를 검증한다. TSX/React 검색은 0건이어야 한다. 실행 뒤 예상하지 않은 tracked delta가 생기면 임의 cleanup하지 않는다."},"387":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-18","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"Architecture contract는 다음을 실제 fixture나 AST 입력으로 검증한다."},"388":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-19","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"package source의 application import와 public boundary 우회 차단"},"389":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-20","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"Foundation의 component/runtime 역방향 dependency 차단"},"390":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-21","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"Primitive의 Composition import와 Composition의 선택적 Capability import 차단"},"391":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-22","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"hardcoded color, arbitrary z-index와 raw transition lint mutation"},"392":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-23","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"Storybook의 network, environment secret와 application provider 의존 차단"},"393":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-24","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"root barrel의 SSR-safe module evaluation"},"394":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-25","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#3-architecture-mutation-contract","content":"fixture를 쓰는 test는 자신의 scoped temporary directory만 정리해야 한다. 전후 status가 다르면 현재 경로를 보존해 보고한다."},"395":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-26","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#4-실제-lint와-dependency-방향","content":"ESLint error는 0건이어야 한다. `typecheck`는 Turbo graph가 upstream package build를 먼저 실행하고 모든 package public type surface를 검사해야 한다. 검증을 통과시키려고 rule, type test나 exclusion을 약화하지 않는다."},"396":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-27","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#5-storybook-purity와-production-build","content":"Storybook은 Foundation CSS와 package source만으로 정적 build해야 한다. Story implementation에는 direct network, environment secret, application API/auth/provider import가 없어야 한다. `pnpm build`는 Tokens → Foundation/Primitives → Compositions의 graph와 publish 대상 dist를 완성한다."},"397":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-28","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#6-full-test와-package-artifact","content":"최종 보고에는 test file/test count, pass/fail 수와 pack smoke test 결과를 포함한다. package artifact는 tracked source나 secret을 포함하지 않고 public exports의 target 파일을 모두 포함해야 한다."},"398":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-29","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#7-package-purity-direct-scan","content":"구현 import 위반은 0건이어야 한다. test string이나 문서 예시가 출력되면 실제 import인지 구분한다. package-private 상대 import는 허용하지만 다른 package의 source tree로 들어가는 physical deep import는 허용하지 않는다."},"399":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-30","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#8-공식-문서와-credential-audit","content":"공식 문서는 여섯 navigation section 순서, 9개 guide migration inventory, Core public 계약, 독립 경로와 tokenless registry 인증을 검증한다. 모든 `_authToken` assignment는 `${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}`만 값으로 사용해야 한다."},"400":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-31","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#9-clean-app-root-docs-build","content":"Foundation `dist`와 docs `.next`가 없는 clean checkout 조건을 만든 뒤 docs app의 자체 command를 실행한다."},"401":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-32","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#9-clean-app-root-docs-build","content":"`prebuild`가 Turbo를 repository root에서 실행해 Tokens와 Foundation의 gitignored dist를 먼저 만들고, 이어서 Next production build가 완료되어야 한다. root orchestration도 별도로 확인한다."},"402":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-33","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#9-clean-app-root-docs-build","content":"두 command 중 app-root command를 bare `next build`로 바꾸면 clean deployment가 실패하므로 conventional `build`와 dependency graph contract를 함께 유지한다."},"403":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-34","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#10-최종-integrity","content":"최종 status는 시작 status와 같아야 한다. build가 만든 `.next`, `.source`, `.turbo`와 package `dist`는 기존 상태를 구분해 정리한다. 예상하지 않은 파일은 삭제하지 말고 상태와 경로를 보존해 보고한다."},"404":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-35","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#실패-귀속","content":"실패 파일이 현재 package/config/docs diff에 포함되는지 확인한다."},"405":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-36","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#실패-귀속","content":"architecture/lint error라면 Core 회귀로 우선 조사한다."},"406":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-37","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#실패-귀속","content":"광역 typecheck/test failure는 base commit에서 동일하게 재현되는지 격리 확인한다."},"407":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-38","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#실패-귀속","content":"base와 head의 오류가 동일하면 기존 부채로 기록하고 이 작업에서 임의 수정하지 않는다."},"408":{"id":"/docs/development/revalidation-39","page_id":"/docs/development/revalidation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/revalidation#실패-귀속","content":"head에만 생긴 오류는 새 regression으로 기록한다."},"409":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"page","content":"Form controls","breadcrumbs":["JLCA 디자인 시스템","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls"},"410":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-0","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls","content":"입력·선택 component의 native semantics, validation, 접근성 계약입니다."},"411":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-1","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls#public-catalog","content":"Public catalog"},"412":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-2","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls#native-controls","content":"Native controls"},"413":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-3","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls#field-and-composition-callbacks","content":"Field and composition callbacks"},"414":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-4","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Choice guide"},"415":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-5","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls#validation-adapter-boundary","content":"Validation adapter boundary"},"416":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-6","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls#quiet-functional-motion","content":"Quiet functional motion"},"417":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-7","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls#accessibility-checklist","content":"Accessibility checklist"},"418":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-8","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/form-controls#verification","content":"Verification"},"419":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-9","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls","content":"Form controls are split between the vendor-neutral primitive package and the\ncomposition package. The primitives own native semantics, keyboard behavior,\nrefs, controlled/uncontrolled state, tokens, and quiet motion. Compositions own\nlabel/description/error relationships and layout; validation policy, form library, schema, and product copy stay in the consuming application."},"420":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-10","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#public-catalog","content":"Import from package roots only. Radix and other implementation types are not\npart of this surface."},"421":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-11","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#public-catalog","content":"`Select` is a single-value compound control. Its public parts are\n`SelectValue`, `SelectTrigger`, `SelectContent`, `SelectGroup`, and\n`SelectOption`; portal scroll buttons and indicators remain private."},"422":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-12","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#native-controls","content":"`Label` accepts native label attributes and `requiredIndicator`. `Textarea`\naccepts native textarea attributes, forwards its ref, and deliberately does\nnot provide autosize or JavaScript height measurement."},"423":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-13","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#native-controls","content":"Checkbox, Radio, and Switch preserve form participation (`name`, `value`,\n`required`, and disabled state) and can be either uncontrolled or controlled."},"424":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-14","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#native-controls","content":"Select supports the same controlled/uncontrolled split and exposes open state\ncallbacks when an app needs to observe it."},"425":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-15","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#native-controls","content":"Select uses a portal and returns focus to its trigger after Escape or dismiss.\nIt intentionally does not implement `NativeSelect`, multi-select,\ncombobox/autocomplete, async filtering, or virtualization. Use a product/app\nadapter when those behaviors are required; do not add them to this primitive."},"426":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-16","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#field-and-composition-callbacks","content":"`Field` render children receive `FieldControlProps`; `ChoiceField` render children receive `ChoiceControlProps`. These public callback contracts keep stable IDs, disabled/required state and described-by relationships owned by the Composition."},"427":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-17","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#field-and-composition-callbacks","content":"`Field` supplies stable `id`, `required`, disabled, invalid, description, and\nerror ARIA props to the control through a render callback. The message area\nreserves one line, so toggling an error does not move a following sibling."},"428":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-18","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#field-and-composition-callbacks","content":"`ChoiceField` applies the same relationship to Checkbox, Radio, or Switch and\nmakes the visible label the click target. `FormGroup` provides a fieldset,\nlegend, and optional group description."},"429":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-19","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#field-and-composition-callbacks","content":"`InputField` remains an aligned convenience composition for an input and\npassword visibility action. New code should use the composition root; consumers should use the Composition package root."},"430":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-20","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Control"},"431":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-21","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Use when"},"432":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-22","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Selection model"},"433":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-23","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Checkbox"},"434":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-24","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Independent yes/no or multiple selections"},"435":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-25","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"zero, one, or many; supports indeterminate"},"436":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-26","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"RadioGroup + Radio"},"437":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-27","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Exactly one option from a visible set"},"438":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-28","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"one value in a group; arrow-key navigation"},"439":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-29","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Switch"},"440":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-30","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"An immediate binary setting"},"441":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-31","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"boolean on/off; use when the state change is the setting itself"},"442":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-32","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#choice-guide","content":"Do not use a Switch as a substitute for a required checkbox consent, or Radio\nfor an independent boolean."},"443":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-33","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#validation-adapter-boundary","content":"The core packages do not depend on RHF, Zod, or product validation messages.\nAn app adapter maps the form library field to the public control and passes\nvalidation state to `Field`:"},"444":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-34","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#validation-adapter-boundary","content":"The `Controller`, schema, option mapping, dependent-field reset, submit\nmutation, and error policy are app concerns. They must not become primitive\nprops or package dependencies."},"445":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-35","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#quiet-functional-motion","content":"Inputs, Textarea, and SelectTrigger transition semantic color, border, and\nfocus ring with `duration-fast` and `ease-standard`."},"446":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-36","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#quiet-functional-motion","content":"Checkbox and Radio transition state color/opacity; Radio's small indicator\ntransform is composited."},"447":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-37","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#quiet-functional-motion","content":"Switch transitions track color and thumb transform with `duration-base` and\n`ease-standard`; its interactive target remains at least 40px."},"448":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-38","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#quiet-functional-motion","content":"Select content uses opacity and a small transform only. Portal positioning is\nlibrary behavior, not an app layout animation."},"449":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-39","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#quiet-functional-motion","content":"No bounce, overshoot, stagger, continuous decoration, frame loop, or\nwidth/height/top/left/margin/padding transition is allowed."},"450":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-40","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#quiet-functional-motion","content":"Every moving control exposes `motion-reduce:transition-none`. Select content\nalso sets `motion-reduce:duration-0`, so `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`\nremoves both the transition property and its computed duration. State and\nkeyboard behavior remain available in reduced motion."},"451":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-41","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#accessibility-checklist","content":"Use a visible `Label`/`ChoiceField` label or an explicit accessible name."},"452":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-42","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#accessibility-checklist","content":"Keep label → description → error in that reading order; use the IDs supplied\nby `Field`/`ChoiceField` rather than duplicating them."},"453":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-43","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#accessibility-checklist","content":"Preserve native `required`, `disabled`, `name`, and form value semantics."},"454":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-44","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#accessibility-checklist","content":"Verify keyboard focus, RadioGroup roving focus, Select typeahead, Escape\ndismissal, and Select trigger focus restoration."},"455":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-45","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#accessibility-checklist","content":"Keep error state on the control with `aria-invalid` and\n`aria-errormessage`; do not move focus or create a live announcement for\nevery keystroke."},"456":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-46","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#accessibility-checklist","content":"Check light/dark contrast, forced colors, visible focus, 40px touch targets,\nand 200%/400% reflow at narrow widths."},"457":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-47","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#accessibility-checklist","content":"Run the real-browser and forced-colors Axe checks before release."},"458":{"id":"/docs/components/form-controls-48","page_id":"/docs/components/form-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/form-controls#verification","content":"Behavior tests cover controlled/uncontrolled state, form participation, Select keyboard/dismiss/focus restoration, and Field relationships. Type tests preserve the public prop surface and reject vendor-private options. Storybook covers default, disabled, invalid, dark, reduced-motion, keyboard, and layout-stability states."},"459":{"id":"/docs/components","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"page","content":"Component 카탈로그","breadcrumbs":["JLCA 디자인 시스템","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components"},"460":{"id":"/docs/components-0","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components","content":"공개된 Core component family의 API, 행동과 소유 경계를 확인합니다."},"461":{"id":"/docs/components-1","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#배치-결정","content":"배치 결정"},"462":{"id":"/docs/components-2","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"Primitive"},"463":{"id":"/docs/components-3","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#composition","content":"Composition"},"464":{"id":"/docs/components-4","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"Capability package"},"465":{"id":"/docs/components-5","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#public-import","content":"Public import"},"466":{"id":"/docs/components-6","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"Layout 공개 계약"},"467":{"id":"/docs/components-7","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"Typography 공개 계약"},"468":{"id":"/docs/components-8","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#table-공개-계약","content":"Table 공개 계약"},"469":{"id":"/docs/components-9","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#button-공개-계약","content":"Button 공개 계약"},"470":{"id":"/docs/components-10","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#input-공개-계약","content":"Input 공개 계약"},"471":{"id":"/docs/components-11","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#inputfield-공개-계약","content":"InputField 공개 계약"},"472":{"id":"/docs/components-12","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#파일-구성","content":"파일 구성"},"473":{"id":"/docs/components-13","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#상태와-접근성-책임","content":"상태와 접근성 책임"},"474":{"id":"/docs/components-14","page_id":"/docs/components","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components#design-system과-domain-view-경계","content":"Design System과 Domain View 경계"},"475":{"id":"/docs/components-15","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components","content":"컴포넌트 위치는 재사용 횟수보다 소유하는 지식, interaction과 dependency로 결정한다. 디자인 시스템 컴포넌트는 제품 도메인과 외부 서비스 없이 fixture만으로 렌더되어야 한다."},"476":{"id":"/docs/components-16","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"Primitive는 디자인 시스템의 최소 공개 UI 단위다. DOM 태그 수가 하나여야 한다는 뜻이 아니라, 하나의 접근성·interaction 계약을 제공한다는 뜻이다."},"477":{"id":"/docs/components-17","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"소유할 수 있다."},"478":{"id":"/docs/components-18","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"focus, keyboard, portal, dismiss"},"479":{"id":"/docs/components-19","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"controlled/uncontrolled UI state"},"480":{"id":"/docs/components-20","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"ARIA widget pattern"},"481":{"id":"/docs/components-21","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"JLCA semantic token 기반 variant, size와 motion"},"482":{"id":"/docs/components-22","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"native element 또는 private headless implementation"},"483":{"id":"/docs/components-23","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"소유할 수 없다."},"484":{"id":"/docs/components-24","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"제품 도메인 용어와 business policy"},"485":{"id":"/docs/components-25","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"Query, API, mutation, auth, router, analytics"},"486":{"id":"/docs/components-26","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"Composition 또는 Capability import"},"487":{"id":"/docs/components-27","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"vendor component/type의 public export"},"488":{"id":"/docs/components-28","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#primitive","content":"Headless library는 구현 디테일이다. 소비자는 JLCA component와 JLCA props type만 import한다."},"489":{"id":"/docs/components-29","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#composition","content":"Composition은 둘 이상의 Primitive를 조합해 반복 가능한 범용 UI 문제를 해결한다."},"490":{"id":"/docs/components-30","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#composition","content":"Composition은 UI 범위의 입력·선택·open state와 명시적 callback을 소유할 수 있다. 제품 DTO, Query result, permission과 route 동작은 받지 않는다. 제품 명칭을 제거했을 때 의미가 무너지면 Composition이 아니라 Domain View다."},"491":{"id":"/docs/components-31","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#composition","content":"Composition은 Chart, Carousel, Map을 import하지 않는다. 범용 core가 선택적 vendor dependency를 끌어오지 않게 하기 위한 비대칭 경계다."},"492":{"id":"/docs/components-32","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"Charts, Carousel, Maps는 core 계층의 위아래가 아니라 선택적으로 소비하는 sibling capability다."},"493":{"id":"/docs/components-33","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"각 package는 다음을 소유한다."},"494":{"id":"/docs/components-34","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"vendor adapter와 version-specific mapping"},"495":{"id":"/docs/components-35","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"JLCA semantic token을 vendor runtime 값으로 바꾸는 adapter"},"496":{"id":"/docs/components-36","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"접근성 fallback과 keyboard/gesture 계약"},"497":{"id":"/docs/components-37","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"필요한 CSS side effect의 좁은 public entry"},"498":{"id":"/docs/components-38","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"vendor에 독립적인 props, event와 data contract"},"499":{"id":"/docs/components-39","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"각 package는 다음을 소유하지 않는다."},"500":{"id":"/docs/components-40","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"제품 KPI, 추천 정책, 매장 상태 같은 business semantics"},"501":{"id":"/docs/components-41","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"다른 Capability package"},"502":{"id":"/docs/components-42","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"앱 Domain, Query, auth, router"},"503":{"id":"/docs/components-43","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"vendor instance/type를 전파하는 public API"},"504":{"id":"/docs/components-44","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#capability-package","content":"Chart의 series 의미, Map marker의 제품 상태, Carousel item 내용은 Domain View가 좁은 display model로 변환해 전달한다."},"505":{"id":"/docs/components-45","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#public-import","content":"APPROVED CORE는 구현된 package root에서만 소비한다."},"506":{"id":"/docs/components-46","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#public-import","content":"다음 CONDITIONAL CAPABILITY import는 해당 package가 생성 조건과 완료 gate를 통과한 뒤에만 허용한다."},"507":{"id":"/docs/components-47","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#public-import","content":"Foundation은 app과 Storybook bootstrap에서 한 번만 적용한다. 이 entry는 현재 구현됐다."},"508":{"id":"/docs/components-48","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#public-import","content":"Tailwind CSS v4 consumer는 CSS entry 위치를 기준으로 installed package `dist` 경로를 조정한다. Foundation import만으로는 component utility가 생성되지 않는다."},"509":{"id":"/docs/components-49","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#public-import","content":"package 내부 구현 경로와 vendor package의 직접 소비는 금지한다."},"510":{"id":"/docs/components-50","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#public-import","content":"현재 `@jaeilnet/design-primitives`에는 Layout, Typography, Form, Table과 Navigation semantic family가 구현됐다. `@jaeilnet/design-compositions`에는 `InputField`, `Field`, `ChoiceField`, `FormGroup`, `Breadcrumb`, `Pagination`이 구현됐다. 위 import block이 현재 Core public catalog다."},"511":{"id":"/docs/components-51","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#public-import","content":"현재 public catalog는 위 두 Core package root가 정본이다. 존재하지 않는 Capability import는 구현·검증 전 production 코드에 추가하지 않는다. Navigation의 구체적인 이름·keyboard·unavailable 계약은 Navigation을 따른다."},"512":{"id":"/docs/components-52","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`Box`는 polymorphic base와 token으로 제한된 spacing, radius, semantic color style prop을 제공한다."},"513":{"id":"/docs/components-53","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`Flex`는 row를 기본으로 direction, align, justify, wrap, gap, rowGap, columnGap을 제공한다."},"514":{"id":"/docs/components-54","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`Stack`은 column flow, `Group`은 align center와 wrap을 기본값으로 하는 row flow다."},"515":{"id":"/docs/components-55","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`Container`는 breakpoint token으로 제한된 scalar max-width, auto inline margin과 SpaceToken gutter를 제공하며 `fluid`일 때 max-width 제한만 제거한다."},"516":{"id":"/docs/components-56","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`Center`는 block 또는 inline flex에서 두 축 중앙 정렬을 고정하며 임의 align/justify 변경을 노출하지 않는다."},"517":{"id":"/docs/components-57","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`RepeatGrid`는 scalar `columns` 1–12와 token `gap`, `rowGap`, `columnGap`으로 동일 너비 track을 반복한다. 선택적 `responsive`는 breakpoint별 `columns`만 덮어쓴다. Mantine의 `SimpleGrid` 이름과 `cols` prop은 복제하지 않는다."},"518":{"id":"/docs/components-58","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`Grid`는 필수 scalar `columns` 1–12로 명시적 track을 만들고, 별도 `GridItem`은 필수 scalar `span` 1–12로 자신이 차지할 열 수를 정한다. 선택적 `responsive`는 각각 breakpoint별 `columns`와 `span`만 받으며 Mantine의 `Grid.Col` namespace API는 복제하지 않는다."},"519":{"id":"/docs/components-59","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`AspectRatio`는 필수 양수 `ratio`를 width/height로 적용하고 요소의 너비는 소비자에게 맡긴다. polymorphic element, native attribute, ref와 Box token을 보존하되 consumer style의 `aspectRatio` 우회는 막는다."},"520":{"id":"/docs/components-60","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"모든 gap과 Box spacing은 `SpaceToken`만 받고 native attribute와 ref를 보존한다."},"521":{"id":"/docs/components-61","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"consumer inline style은 비레이아웃 값만 허용하며 flex, grid template·placement, spacing, color 계약을 우회하지 않는다."},"522":{"id":"/docs/components-62","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"Grid 계열의 기준값은 항상 scalar prop이다. `responsive`는 `base` 없이 `mobile`, `mobile.s`, `tablet`, `laptop`, `laptop.lg`, `laptop.xl`의 min-width override만 받는다."},"523":{"id":"/docs/components-63","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"responsive Grid class는 완전한 Tailwind literal lookup으로 생성한다. dotted token은 `mobile-s:`, `laptop-lg:`, `laptop-xl:` variant로 변환하며 template string으로 class를 조립하지 않는다."},"524":{"id":"/docs/components-64","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#layout-공개-계약","content":"`Space`는 현재 만들지 않는다. Stack/Flex/Grid gap과 Box margin으로 실제 간격 요구를 표현할 수 있고, 조사된 빈 요소는 구분선·드래그 핸들·스켈레톤이라 spacer가 아니다. Grid의 responsive columns/span만 승인됐으며 responsive spacing·Flex 속성, offset, order와 row span은 아직 공개하지 않는다."},"525":{"id":"/docs/components-65","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"Typography Core family는 다음 여섯 개의 독립 export다."},"526":{"id":"/docs/components-66","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`TextSize = '2xs' | 'xs' | 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg' | 'xl'`"},"527":{"id":"/docs/components-67","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`TextWeight = 'regular' | 'medium' | 'semibold' | 'bold'`"},"528":{"id":"/docs/components-68","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`TextTone = 'accent' | 'danger' | 'default' | 'info' | 'inherit' | 'inverse' | 'muted' | 'secondary' | 'success' | 'warning'`"},"529":{"id":"/docs/components-69","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`TextAlign = 'center' | 'end' | 'justify' | 'start'`"},"530":{"id":"/docs/components-70","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`TextWrap = 'balance' | 'nowrap' | 'pretty' | 'wrap'`"},"531":{"id":"/docs/components-71","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`TextLineClamp = 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6`"},"532":{"id":"/docs/components-72","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`Text`는 기본 `p`이며 polymorphic `as`, native props와 ref를 보존한다. 기본값은 `md`, `regular`, `default`, `start`, `pretty`다. `truncate`와 `lineClamp`는 동시에 사용할 수 없고 중요한 정보의 유일한 표현에 사용하지 않는다."},"533":{"id":"/docs/components-73","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`Title`의 필수 `order=1..6`은 실제 `h1..h6`를 정하고 선택적 `size=1..6`은 시각 위계만 정한다. size 1–2 기본 weight는 bold, 3–6은 semibold이며 arbitrary `as`를 제공하지 않는다."},"534":{"id":"/docs/components-74","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`Code`는 기본 `<code>`이고 `block`일 때 focus 가능한 `<pre><code>`다. 크기는 `xs | sm | md`만 제공하며 syntax highlighting, copy action과 line number는 Composition 책임이다."},"535":{"id":"/docs/components-75","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`Blockquote`는 native URL `cite`와 화면에 보이는 `citation`을 분리한다. citation은 `<footer><cite>`로 렌더하고 tone은 `default | accent`만 제공한다. 장식 인용부호는 CSS presentation이다."},"536":{"id":"/docs/components-76","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"`List`는 `type=\"ordered | unordered\"`에 따라 실제 `ol | ul`을 렌더한다. ordered marker는 `decimal | lower-alpha | upper-alpha`, unordered marker는 `disc | circle | square`, spacing은 `none | xs | sm | md | lg`다. ordered만 `start`와 `reversed`를 받으며 별도 `ListItem`은 native `li`와 `value`를 보존한다. `List.Item` namespace와 custom icon marker는 제공하지 않는다."},"537":{"id":"/docs/components-77","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#typography-공개-계약","content":"Typography가 소유하는 color, font family/size/style/weight, letter spacing, line height, 정렬·wrap·축약과 native 구조는 public `style`로 우회할 수 없다. Foundation이 설치한 generated token 변수만 소비한다."},"538":{"id":"/docs/components-78","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#table-공개-계약","content":"Table semantic family는 native HTML table model을 그대로 드러내는 열한 개의 독립 export다."},"539":{"id":"/docs/components-79","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#table-공개-계약","content":"Export"},"540":{"id":"/docs/components-80","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#table-공개-계약","content":"Native element"},"541":{"id":"/docs/components-81","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#table-공개-계약","content":"책임"},"542":{"id":"/docs/components-82","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#table-공개-계약","content":"`Table`"},"543":{"id":"/docs/components-83","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#table-공개-계약","content":"`table`"},"544":{"id":"/docs/components-84","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#table-공개-계약","content":"density, border, stripe와 table layout"},"545":{"id