chitecture가 소유한다."},"607":{"id":"/docs/components-147","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#design-system과-domain-view-경계","content":"다음 중 하나라도 참이면 앱 Domain View에 둔다."},"608":{"id":"/docs/components-148","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#design-system과-domain-view-경계","content":"Lotto 구매, 매장, 추천, 계정처럼 제품 어휘를 사용한다."},"609":{"id":"/docs/components-149","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#design-system과-domain-view-경계","content":"한 use case의 loading/empty/error/success 의미를 표현한다."},"610":{"id":"/docs/components-150","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#design-system과-domain-view-경계","content":"Domain Model을 전제로 한 레이아웃이나 문구를 가진다."},"611":{"id":"/docs/components-151","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#design-system과-domain-view-경계","content":"여러 Capability를 제품 의미로 조립한다."},"612":{"id":"/docs/components-152","page_id":"/docs/components","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components#design-system과-domain-view-경계","content":"Domain View도 순수 UI여야 하지만 디자인 시스템의 공개·버전·의존성 정책에는 포함하지 않는다. 전체 연결 규칙은 consuming application architecture를 따른다."},"613":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","type":"page","content":"Navigation","breadcrumbs":["JLCA 디자인 시스템","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/navigation"},"614":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-0","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation","content":"구현 완료된 Navigation semantic family의 공개 API, 접근성 계약과 application 경계를 설명합니다."},"615":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-1","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/navigation#상태","content":"상태"},"616":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-2","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/navigation#공개-api","content":"공개 API"},"617":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-3","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/navigation#link와-navigation","content":"Link와 Navigation"},"618":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-4","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/navigation#skiplink","content":"SkipLink"},"619":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-5","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/navigation#breadcrumb","content":"Breadcrumb"},"620":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-6","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/navigation#pagination","content":"Pagination"},"621":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-7","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/navigation#검증-범위","content":"검증 범위"},"622":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-8","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#상태","content":"전체 상태: **구현 완료**"},"623":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-9","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#상태","content":"Tokens, Primitives, Compositions의 public root와 Storybook catalog에서 제공한다."},"624":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-10","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#상태","content":"runtime, type, SSR, contrast, package artifact와 real-browser gate가 Navigation family를 검증한다."},"625":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-11","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#상태","content":"Foundation CSS는 application 또는 Storybook bootstrap에서 한 번 불러온다. Tailwind CSS v4는 설치된 library의 `node_modules` JavaScript를 자동으로 scan하지 않으므로, project root의 CSS entry에서 Primitives와 Compositions `dist`도 명시한다."},"626":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-12","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#상태","content":"`@source` 경로는 이 CSS 파일을 기준으로 계산한다. CSS entry가 `src/` 아래에 있다면 `../node_modules/...`처럼 실제 상대 경로를 조정한다. 이 두 source가 없으면 token 변수는 설치돼도 Link, SkipLink, Breadcrumb와 Pagination의 component utility는 생성되지 않는다."},"627":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-13","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#공개-api","content":"Navigation family는 목적지 이동, 이름 있는 navigation landmark와 현재 위치 표현만 소유한다. Router, URL 계산, breadcrumb path, page range, cursor, auth와 메뉴 정책은 application이 소유한다."},"628":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-14","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#link와-navigation","content":"`Link`는 native anchor가 기본이다. `asChild`는 `React.forwardRef`로 만든 anchor adapter 하나만 받는다. Adapter는 자체 default 뒤에 전달받은 accessibility와 native anchor props를 spread하고, ref를 실제 단일 `<a>`의 `HTMLAnchorElement`로 전달해야 한다. Link는 함수/class/non-forwarding adapter를 render 전에 거부하고, mounted ref target도 anchor인지 검증한다. Fragment, 여러 children과 button child는 올바른 Link adapter가 아니다."},"629":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-15","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#link와-navigation","content":"임의 composite adapter는 신뢰 경계다. 전달받은 props를 무시하거나 뒤에서 덮어쓰는 adapter는 contract를 충족하지 않는다."},"630":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-16","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#link와-navigation","content":"모든 `Navigation`, `Breadcrumb`, `Pagination` landmark는 비어 있지 않은 `aria-label` 또는 `aria-labelledby` 중 하나를 가져야 한다. `aria-labelledby`가 가리키는 element의 존재와 수명은 application 책임이다."},"631":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-17","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#skiplink","content":"`SkipLink`는 같은 문서의 실제 fragment target만 받는다. `href=\"#\"`는 bypass destination이 아니므로 runtime에서 거부된다."},"632":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-18","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#skiplink","content":"SkipLink는 반복 탐색보다 앞선 keyboard stop이어야 한다. focus 시 화면에 나타나고 forced colors와 reduced motion 설정을 존중한다."},"633":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-19","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#breadcrumb","content":"Breadcrumb path는 application이 명시적인 children으로 작성한다. 구분자는 장식이며 현재 위치는 link가 아닌 `BreadcrumbCurrent`가 `aria-current=\"page\"`로 표시한다."},"634":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-20","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#pagination","content":"page range와 이동 가능 여부는 application이 계산한다. 활성 목적지는 `PaginationLink` 또는 `PaginationControl` anchor이고, `unavailable` control은 tab order와 interaction handler가 없는 inert `<span>`으로 렌더된다. Ellipsis는 `aria-hidden=\"true\"`인 presentation이다."},"635":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-21","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#pagination","content":"Unavailable content는 plain text만 허용하고 portal, raw HTML, event와 ARIA escape를 제거한다. `asChild` control에서는 바깥 `aria-label`이 adapter의 이름보다 우선한다."},"636":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-22","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#검증-범위","content":"375×812와 1280×900에서 localized direction label reflow"},"637":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-23","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#검증-범위","content":"실제 keyboard tab order, SkipLink focus와 fragment bypass"},"638":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-24","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#검증-범위","content":"forced colors focus outline과 reduced motion"},"639":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-25","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#검증-범위","content":"named landmark, current page, unavailable control, hidden ellipsis"},"640":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-26","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#검증-범위","content":"unavailable portal/raw HTML escape 차단과 `asChild` authoritative label"},"641":{"id":"/docs/components/navigation-27","page_id":"/docs/components/navigation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/navigation#검증-범위","content":"Storybook axe serious/critical violation 0건"},"642":{"id":"/docs/principles","page_id":"/docs/principles","type":"page","content":"설계 원칙","breadcrumbs":["JLCA 디자인 시스템","설계 원칙"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles"},"643":{"id":"/docs/principles-0","page_id":"/docs/principles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles","content":"JLCA Core가 어떤 결정을 소유하고 무엇을 거절하는지 설명합니다."},"644":{"id":"/docs/principles-1","page_id":"/docs/principles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles#token-first","content":"Token-first"},"645":{"id":"/docs/principles-2","page_id":"/docs/principles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles#headless-implementation-jlca-contract","content":"Headless implementation, JLCA contract"},"646":{"id":"/docs/principles-3","page_id":"/docs/principles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles#product-independent","content":"Product-independent"},"647":{"id":"/docs/principles-4","page_id":"/docs/principles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles#quiet-functional-motion","content":"Quiet functional motion"},"648":{"id":"/docs/principles-5","page_id":"/docs/principles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles#공개-경계-우선","content":"공개 경계 우선"},"649":{"id":"/docs/principles-6","page_id":"/docs/principles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles#token-first","content":"색상, 간격, typography, motion은 component보다 먼저 token으로 정의합니다. Component는 raw 값이나 theme 분기 대신 semantic alias를 소비합니다."},"650":{"id":"/docs/principles-7","page_id":"/docs/principles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles#headless-implementation-jlca-contract","content":"복잡한 접근성 interaction은 검증된 headless 구현을 사용할 수 있습니다. 그러나 공개 prop, event, type과 표현 규칙은 JLCA가 소유하며 vendor type을 노출하지 않습니다."},"651":{"id":"/docs/principles-8","page_id":"/docs/principles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles#product-independent","content":"Core는 제품명, API, route, auth, analytics를 모릅니다. 제품 용어를 제거했을 때 의미가 무너지는 UI는 downstream product view에 둡니다."},"652":{"id":"/docs/principles-9","page_id":"/docs/principles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles#quiet-functional-motion","content":"모션은 상태 변화와 공간 관계를 설명합니다. Motion token을 사용하고 `transform`과 `opacity`를 우선하며, reduced motion에서도 의미가 유지되어야 합니다."},"653":{"id":"/docs/principles-10","page_id":"/docs/principles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles#공개-경계-우선","content":"소비자는 package root만 import합니다. 내부 경로, vendor package, generated file은 공개 계약이 아닙니다."},"654":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"page","content":"계층과 소유권","breadcrumbs":["JLCA 디자인 시스템","설계 원칙"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership"},"655":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-0","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership","content":"Tokens, Foundation, Primitives, Compositions의 단방향 책임을 정의합니다."},"656":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-1","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"의존 규칙"},"657":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-2","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"Token 규칙"},"658":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-3","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"모션과 애니메이션 규칙"},"659":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-4","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#public-surface","content":"Public surface"},"660":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-5","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#web-의미론-계열-규칙","content":"Web 의미론 계열 규칙"},"661":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-6","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#storybook-순수성","content":"Storybook 순수성"},"662":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-7","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#반응형-layout-규칙","content":"반응형 Layout 규칙"},"663":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-8","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#vendor-예외","content":"Vendor 예외"},"664":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-9","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/principles/ownership#application-handoff","content":"Application handoff"},"665":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-10","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership","content":"이 문서는 현재 Core 의존 규칙과 선택적 Capability의 진입 조건을 구분한다. 구현 정본은 package manifest, `eslint.config.mjs`, `eslint-rules/`와 architecture contract test이며 문서는 실행 가능한 경계를 설명한다."},"666":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-11","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"소비 package"},"667":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-12","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"허용"},"668":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-13","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"금지"},"669":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-14","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Tokens"},"670":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-15","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"없음"},"671":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-16","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"React, DOM, 앱, UI vendor"},"672":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-17","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Foundation"},"673":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-18","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Tokens"},"674":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-19","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Primitives, Compositions, Capability, 앱"},"675":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-20","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Primitives"},"676":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-21","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Tokens, package-private UI/style vendor"},"677":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-22","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Foundation runtime, 상위 package, 앱"},"678":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-23","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Compositions"},"679":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-24","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Primitives, Tokens"},"680":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-25","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Capability, 앱, 제품 도메인"},"681":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-26","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Charts"},"682":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-27","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Compositions, Primitives, Tokens, chart vendor"},"683":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-28","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Carousel, Maps, 앱, 제품 정책"},"684":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-29","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Carousel"},"685":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-30","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Compositions, Primitives, Tokens, carousel vendor"},"686":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-31","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Charts, Maps, 앱, 제품 정책"},"687":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-32","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Maps"},"688":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-33","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Compositions, Primitives, Tokens, map vendor"},"689":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-34","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Charts, Carousel, 앱, 제품 정책"},"690":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-35","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"공통 원칙:"},"691":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-36","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"앱과 다른 package는 public `exports`만 사용한다."},"692":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-37","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"headless/vendor type, instance와 경로를 public API에 노출하지 않는다."},"693":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-38","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"package끼리 source deep import하지 않는다."},"694":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-39","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Foundation은 React package dependency가 아니라 app/Storybook bootstrap의 필수 CSS prerequisite다. Primitive는 Foundation이 설치한 semantic CSS variable 계약을 전제로 한다."},"695":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-40","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Foundation 없이 Primitive를 사용하는 환경은 공식 지원하지 않는다. 별도 embed 환경은 최소 token CSS entry와 smoke test를 먼저 설계한다."},"696":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-41","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"Composition은 선택적 Capability dependency를 끌어오지 않는다."},"697":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-42","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"디자인 시스템에서 `apps/**`, `next/*`, API, Query, auth, router, analytics를 import하지 않는다."},"698":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-43","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#의존-규칙","content":"root barrel은 server-side module evaluation에서 browser global을 실행하지 않는다. Client-only module은 명시적인 client boundary, lazy loading과 SSR fallback 계약을 가진다."},"699":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-44","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"다음 값은 raw literal보다 semantic token을 사용한다."},"700":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-45","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"color와 contrast pair"},"701":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-46","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"spacing과 size scale"},"702":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-47","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"radius와 elevation"},"703":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-48","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"z-index와 overlay level"},"704":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-49","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"duration, easing과 motion preference"},"705":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-50","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"typography role"},"706":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-51","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#token-규칙","content":"현재 `ds/no-hardcoded-color`, `ds/no-arbitrary-zindex`, `ds/no-raw-transition`이 JavaScript/TypeScript/JSX의 주요 drift를 차단한다. raw CSS와 vendor runtime adapter도 같은 의미 계약을 review에서 확인한다."},"707":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-52","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"JLCA는 \\*\\*절제된 기능적 모션(quiet functional motion)\\*\\*을 사용한다. 모션의 목적은 화면을 꾸미는 것이 아니라 상태 변화, 입력 결과와 공간 관계를 빠르게 설명하는 것이다. 아기자기한 bounce, 과장된 overshoot, 반복 장식과 시선을 빼앗는 연출은 사용하지 않는다."},"708":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-53","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"Primitive는 hover, pressed, checked, open/closed처럼 자신이 소유한 UI 상태의 모션을 함께 소유한다. 별도의 범용 `Animation` 컴포넌트나 application animation service를 만들지 않는다."},"709":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-54","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"duration과 easing은 `@jaeilnet/design-tokens`의 motion token을 사용한다. component source에 `150ms`, `duration-200` 또는 임의 cubic-bezier를 직접 추가하지 않는다."},"710":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-55","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"기본 피드백은 `duration.fast`, 일반 상태 전환은 `duration.base` 안에서 끝낸다. `duration.slow`는 Switch thumb처럼 공간 이동을 읽어야 하는 제한된 경우에만 사용한다."},"711":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-56","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"기본 easing은 감속형 `ease.standard`다. spring은 bounce나 overshoot가 없는 경우에만 허용하며, 귀엽거나 탄성적인 인상을 만드는 spring은 사용하지 않는다."},"712":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-57","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"성능과 시각적 안정성을 위해 `transform`, `opacity`, `color`, `background-color`, `border-color`, `box-shadow`를 우선한다. `top`, `left`, `width`, `height`, margin, padding처럼 매 프레임 layout과 주변 콘텐츠 배치를 다시 계산하는 속성은 일반 transition 대상으로 삼지 않는다."},"713":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-58","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"`transform`을 사용하더라도 주변 레이아웃 공간은 최종 크기로 먼저 확보한다. 오류·도움말·로딩 콘텐츠는 필요한 공간을 예약하거나 overlay/portal로 분리하여 등장할 때 형제 요소를 밀지 않는다."},"714":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-59","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"동시에 여러 요소를 순차적으로 튀게 하는 stagger, 무한 반복과 큰 거리 이동은 기본 컴포넌트에서 금지한다. 지속 모션은 진행 중임을 알려야 하는 spinner, progress, skeleton처럼 실제 상태가 있는 경우로 제한한다."},"715":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-60","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"`prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`에서는 의미와 조작 가능성을 보존한 채 이동과 반복을 제거하고 상태를 즉시 또는 거의 즉시 전환한다."},"716":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-61","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"Storybook과 테스트는 최소한 default/active/disabled/open 상태, reduced-motion 계약과 애니메이션 중 layout shift가 없는 구조를 검증한다. 수동 검토는 저사양 모바일 기준으로 끊김, 긴 main-thread 작업과 불필요한 repaint가 없는지 확인한다."},"717":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-62","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#모션과-애니메이션-규칙","content":"권장 인상은 “통통 튀는 재미”가 아니라 **눌렀다는 감각은 분명하지만 화면은 흔들리지 않는 단단한 반응**이다. 예를 들어 Checkbox는 색과 check 표시를 짧게 전환하고, Switch는 track 색과 thumb 위치만 이동하며, Select는 이미 확보된 trigger를 유지한 채 portal content의 opacity와 작은 `transform`만 전환한다."},"718":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-63","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#public-surface","content":"Form Controls와 validation adapter의 public catalog, callback 예시, 접근성·모션 계약은 Form Controls에 정리한다."},"719":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-64","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#public-surface","content":"APPROVED CORE public package:"},"720":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-65","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#public-surface","content":"생성 조건을 통과한 경우에만 추가하는 CONDITIONAL CAPABILITY:"},"721":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-66","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#public-surface","content":"각 package root는 안정된 소비자 API만 공개한다. CSS side effect가 필요하면 `styles.css`처럼 이름이 드러나는 좁은 export를 사용한다. root barrel을 import하는 것만으로 Chart, Carousel, Map runtime/CSS가 설치되어서는 안 된다."},"722":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-67","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#web-의미론-계열-규칙","content":"Core family는 외부 library의 catalog가 아니라 Layout, Typography, Form, Table, Navigation, Media, Document Structure, Interactive Content라는 Web 의미 체계에서 책임을 정한다."},"723":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-68","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#web-의미론-계열-규칙","content":"후보 family 이름은 public component나 API 승인을 뜻하지 않는다. 구현됨 상태는 native semantics, token/style ownership, 접근성, SSR, type, Story, 문서와 dependency gate를 모두 닫은 뒤에만 부여한다."},"724":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-69","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#web-의미론-계열-규칙","content":"native HTML element가 요구를 표현하면 ARIA role로 다시 만들지 않는다. ARIA composite widget은 native model로 표현할 수 없는 interaction과 keyboard 계약이 승인된 경우에만 설계한다."},"725":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-70","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#web-의미론-계열-규칙","content":"Table은 static tabular data의 native structure를 소유한다. 좁은 viewport에서도 `table`, `thead`, `tbody`, `tfoot`, `tr`, `th`, `td`의 display를 block/grid/flex로 바꾸거나 행을 card로 변환하지 않는다. overflow는 이름 있는 opt-in `TableScrollArea`가 소유하며, `Table` 자체는 wrapper, grid role, selection, editing, sorting state와 cell keyboard navigation을 만들지 않는다. interactive DataGrid는 Table prop 확장이 아니라 별도 설계다."},"726":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-71","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#storybook-순수성","content":"디자인 시스템 Story는 다음 없이 렌더되어야 한다."},"727":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-72","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#storybook-순수성","content":"direct fetch, XHR, WebSocket, EventSource"},"728":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-73","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#storybook-순수성","content":"app QueryClient, generated API, auth/router provider"},"729":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-74","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#storybook-순수성","content":"environment secret"},"730":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-75","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#storybook-순수성","content":"제품 Domain fixture import"},"731":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-76","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#storybook-순수성","content":"local fixture와 action callback으로 light/dark, interaction, error/empty/disabled 상태를 표현한다. theme·locale처럼 안정된 UI 환경 decorator는 허용하지만 application service를 숨기지 않는다."},"732":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-77","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#storybook-순수성","content":"각 공개 component는 usage·non-usage, 상태 matrix, theme·viewport, keyboard play test, 접근성 주의와 Composition 예시를 제공한다."},"733":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-78","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#반응형-layout-규칙","content":"`RepeatGrid.columns`, `Grid.columns`, `GridItem.span`은 scalar base와 별도 `responsive` override를 사용한다."},"734":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-79","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#반응형-layout-규칙","content":"breakpoint는 `mobile` → `mobile.s` → `tablet` → `laptop` → `laptop.lg` → `laptop.xl`의 mobile-first min-width 순서다."},"735":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-80","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#반응형-layout-규칙","content":"dotted token은 Tailwind variant에서 hyphen으로 바꾼다: `mobile.s` → `mobile-s:`, `laptop.lg` → `laptop-lg:`, `laptop.xl` → `laptop-xl:`."},"736":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-81","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#반응형-layout-규칙","content":"Tailwind source detection을 위해 가능한 모든 1–12 조합은 package-private 완전 literal map에 존재해야 한다. class fragment를 런타임에 결합하지 않는다."},"737":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-82","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#반응형-layout-규칙","content":"responsive spacing, Flex/Stack/Group 속성, offset, order, row span과 임의 template은 아직 공개 계약이 아니다."},"738":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-83","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#vendor-예외","content":"Vendor가 raw runtime 값을 요구해도 가능한 한 token을 adapter에서 해석한다."},"739":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-84","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#vendor-예외","content":"Chart.js 색은 CSS custom property 또는 typed token에서 읽는다."},"740":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-85","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#vendor-예외","content":"Maps SDK의 marker HTML/JS option도 semantic role에서 값을 얻는다."},"741":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-86","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#vendor-예외","content":"Carousel global CSS는 Carousel package의 명시적 style entry로만 노출한다."},"742":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-87","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#vendor-예외","content":"Radix portal positioning이 주입하는 `top`, `left`, `transform`은 library internal behavior로 취급한다."},"743":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-88","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#vendor-예외","content":"불가피한 lint 예외는 가장 좁은 한 줄에 기술적 이유를 남긴다. package boundary 위반에는 escape hatch를 쓰지 않고 책임을 옮긴다."},"744":{"id":"/docs/principles/ownership-89","page_id":"/docs/principles/ownership","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/principles/ownership#application-handoff","content":"제품 용어, 화면 상태와 use case가 등장하면 디자인 시스템 문서의 범위를 벗어난다. consuming application의 View와 orchestration 규칙을 따른다."},"745":{"id":"/docs/tokens","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"page","content":"Token 카탈로그","breadcrumbs":["JLCA 디자인 시스템","Tokens"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens"},"746":{"id":"/docs/tokens-0","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens","content":"JLCA의 디자인 결정을 reference, semantic, component 계층으로 사용합니다."},"747":{"id":"/docs/tokens-1","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"목표 계층"},"748":{"id":"/docs/tokens-2","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens#source","content":"Source"},"749":{"id":"/docs/tokens-3","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens#primary와-theme-설계","content":"Primary와 theme 설계"},"750":{"id":"/docs/tokens-4","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens#foundation-handoff","content":"Foundation handoff"},"751":{"id":"/docs/tokens-5","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens#capability-token","content":"Capability token"},"752":{"id":"/docs/tokens-6","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens#layout-scale","content":"Layout scale"},"753":{"id":"/docs/tokens-7","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens#현재와-목표","content":"현재와 목표"},"754":{"id":"/docs/tokens-8","page_id":"/docs/tokens","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/tokens#변경-규칙","content":"변경 규칙"},"755":{"id":"/docs/tokens-9","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens","content":"`@jaeilnet/design-tokens`는 브랜드 디자인 결정의 유일한 정본이다. Foundation과 모든 component/capability package는 이 값을 소비하며 별도 palette를 만들지 않는다."},"756":{"id":"/docs/tokens-10","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"단계"},"757":{"id":"/docs/tokens-11","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"예"},"758":{"id":"/docs/tokens-12","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"역할"},"759":{"id":"/docs/tokens-13","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"Reference/Global"},"760":{"id":"/docs/tokens-14","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"`color.blue.600`, `space.4`, `radius.md`"},"761":{"id":"/docs/tokens-15","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"raw palette와 scale"},"762":{"id":"/docs/tokens-16","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"Semantic/Alias"},"763":{"id":"/docs/tokens-17","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"`color.action.primary.background`, `color.surface.default`, `color.content.muted`"},"764":{"id":"/docs/tokens-18","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"사용 의미와 theme 계약"},"765":{"id":"/docs/tokens-19","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"Component"},"766":{"id":"/docs/tokens-20","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"`typography.text.md.fontSize`, `table.density.compact.paddingBlock`"},"767":{"id":"/docs/tokens-21","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"반복되고 독립 진화하는 component 계약"},"768":{"id":"/docs/tokens-22","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#목표-계층","content":"컴포넌트는 가능한 한 semantic token을 사용한다. component token은 같은 조합이 반복되거나 component가 global semantic과 다른 생명주기를 가져야 할 때만 추가한다."},"769":{"id":"/docs/tokens-23","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#source","content":"`reference`, `semantic`, `component/typography.json`, `component/table.json`이 현재 source에 적용됐다. component token은 반복되고 독립 진화하는 계약이 확인될 때만 추가한다."},"770":{"id":"/docs/tokens-24","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#source","content":"현재 semantic color는 action, content, surface, border, feedback, focus 역할을 Light/Dark 동일 경로로 제공한다. content에는 `primary | secondary | muted | inverse | accent | success | warning | danger | info`가 있으며 기본 surface 위 text pair는 4.5:1, focus indicator는 3:1 contrast gate를 통과해야 한다."},"771":{"id":"/docs/tokens-25","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#source","content":"Typography reference는 `fontFamily.sans`, `fontFamily.mono`, 기존 font size/weight/line-height/letter-spacing scale을 제공한다. component recipe는 `--typography-text-*`, `--typography-title-*`, `--typography-code-*` CSS 변수로 생성되고 Foundation의 기본 font는 `--font-family-sans`를 사용한다. 기존 `.text-heading-*`, `.typo-body*`, `.typo-caption*` utility는 Legacy 호환 값으로 유지한다."},"772":{"id":"/docs/tokens-26","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#source","content":"Table component recipe는 다음 열 개의 generated variable을 제공한다."},"773":{"id":"/docs/tokens-27","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#source","content":"compact/default/relaxed density는 reference space에 alias되고 font size, header weight와 line height는 typography reference에 alias된다. Table의 surface, content, border와 focus color는 component token으로 복제하지 않고 기존 semantic color 변수를 직접 소비하므로 light/dark 경로가 같다."},"774":{"id":"/docs/tokens-28","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#primary와-theme-설계","content":"현재 승인된 Primary는 기존 orange palette다."},"775":{"id":"/docs/tokens-29","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#primary와-theme-설계","content":"light `primary.500`: `oklch(0.68 0.23 45)`"},"776":{"id":"/docs/tokens-30","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags