light semantic variable을 설치하고 `[data-theme='dark']`에서 같은 semantic path의 값을 교체한다."},"788":{"id":"/docs/tokens-42","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#foundation-handoff","content":"Tokens가 **무엇을 사용할지** 결정한다면 Foundation은 그 결정을 Web에서 **어떻게 설치할지** 책임진다."},"789":{"id":"/docs/tokens-43","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#foundation-handoff","content":"Tokens: JSON/typed data, alias resolution, generated CSS variable data"},"790":{"id":"/docs/tokens-44","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#foundation-handoff","content":"Foundation: selector, reset, font, color-scheme, theme bootstrap, styling engine binding"},"791":{"id":"/docs/tokens-45","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#foundation-handoff","content":"Tokens source에는 CSS selector, Tailwind directive, React provider와 앱 route를 넣지 않는다. Foundation은 token 값을 재정의하지 않는다."},"792":{"id":"/docs/tokens-46","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#capability-token","content":"Chart/Map처럼 JavaScript runtime 값이 필요한 경우에도 raw hex를 package source에 넣지 않는다."},"793":{"id":"/docs/tokens-47","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#capability-token","content":"CSS custom property를 `getComputedStyle`로 읽거나"},"794":{"id":"/docs/tokens-48","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#capability-token","content":"`@jaeilnet/design-tokens`의 typed resolved value를 사용한다."},"795":{"id":"/docs/tokens-49","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#capability-token","content":"제품별 series·marker 의미는 Domain View가 semantic role로 매핑하고 Capability는 해당 role을 JLCA token으로 표현한다."},"796":{"id":"/docs/tokens-50","page_id":"/docs/tokens","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/tokens#layout-scale","content":"Box, Flex, Stack, Group, Container, Center, RepeatGrid, Grid, GridItem, AspectRatio와 이후 layout Primitive의 spacing, radius, breakp